{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>Like the moon</b> — He mentioned the sun, which is the great luminary, and just as it stands forever before HaShem, so shall the kingdom of David stand; he also mentioned the lesser luminary." "<b>And the word 'it shall be established' (יכון)</b> — it has upon its seed the sense of עולם like לעולם, and the moon ['as witness'] is faithful."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 89, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:36.455511292Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}